  "description": "**\"Clearly, I was only supposed to provide the milk... So why is he kissing me?!\"**\n\nMary has a secret she has guarded her entire life: despite being a virgin, her body produces breast milk. Desperate for a fresh start after years of humiliation, she secures a job at a prestigious marquisate; only to be exposed on day 1 by Asher, the brilliant eldest son and lead medical researcher.\n\nExpecting the worst, Mary is stunned when Asher offers her a confidential contract: treatment for her condition in exchange for regular milk samples.\nThe arrangement seems straightforward enough; until Asher’s physical examinations begin crossing every professional boundary imaginable.\n\n As the line between medical research and undeniable desire blurs, Asher makes a revelation of his own:\n**\"Forget the research data, Mary. It's you I want to analyze.\"**\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6402000002)",
